The answer keys listed in keys.yaml, and the data this project publishes
(labels, page positions and lists of scans), are dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0 Universal, as far as any right in them belongs to
this project: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Each answer key's source and its own terms are named in keys.yaml and in
the manifest of the published zip. The code of this project is licensed
under the Apache License 2.0 (../LICENSE), and so are its model weights.
